fixture dash_cancel_keeps_earlier_attack_control
doc Control for dash_cancel_keeps_earlier_attack (movement review 4, L1): the dash one frame earlier (side 1's frame 5), the attack 3 frames old at the cancel; side 2 comes out on dash frame 6.
room test/flat
spawn 200 544
frames 30
input
  0 !attack
  1 !attack
  2..3
  4 dash
  5..29
end
expect
  at 0 action=side1
  at 4 event.dash=1 state=dash action=none
  at 9 event.attack=1 action=side2
end
